<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hormozdgan" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-hormozdgan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/april-28">28 April</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Ardashir I defeats Artabanus IV at the Battle of Hormozdgan</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">At Hormozdgan, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ardashir-i">Ardashir I</a> defeated the Parthian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/artabanus-iv">Artabanus IV</a>, who was killed. The victory ended almost five centuries of Parthian rule in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a> and marked the start of the Sasanian era.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hormozdgan">Battle of Hormozdgan</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/parthian-empire">Parthian Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
