<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/parthian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Parthian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Parthian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ardashir I kills Artabanus IV at Hormozdgan, founding the Sasanian Empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/sasanian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sasanian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sasanian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ardashir I defeats and kills the last Parthian king, Artabanus IV, at Hormozdgan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/zoroastrianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Zoroastrianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Zoroastrianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ardashir I founds the Sasanian Empire, under which Zoroastrianism becomes the state religion</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/middle-persian"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Middle%20Persian.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Middle Persian</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sasanians, native speakers of Middle Persian, take power from the Parthian Arsacids, and Middle Persian becomes the prestige language of the state</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/avesta"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Avesta.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Avesta</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Sasanian era begins, the period in which the Avestan alphabet is created and the Avesta first written down</span></li></ul></section>
